# Smart Inventory Management System

## Overview

Smart Inventory Management System is an AI-powered web application designed to simplify and automate inventory operations for businesses. The platform centralizes procurement, inventory tracking, stock management, sales, and reporting into a single dashboard, reducing manual effort and improving operational efficiency.

The application implements role-based access control to ensure that users only have access to features relevant to their responsibilities. Administrators gain a complete overview of business operations, while Sales and Procurement teams can efficiently manage their respective workflows.

AI-powered insights generated using Groq assist users in making informed inventory decisions, identifying stock trends, and improving overall inventory planning.

---

## Features

### Role-Based Access Control

**Admin**

* Complete business overview
* Inventory dashboard
* AI Assistant
* Audit Trail
* Stock Tracking
* Stock Adjustment Panel
* User Management
* Reports and Analytics

**Sales**

* Create and manage sales orders
* Track order status
* Update inventory after sales
* View customer orders

**Procurement**

* Manage suppliers
* Create purchase orders
* Track procurement orders
* Receive inventory
* Restock products

---

## Core Modules

### Inventory Dashboard

* Real-time inventory statistics
* Stock availability overview
* Low-stock monitoring
* Inventory performance metrics
* Sales and procurement summaries

### Inventory Management

* Product management
* Category management
* SKU management
* Real-time stock updates
* Product search and filtering

### Stock Tracking

* Monitor stock movement
* View inventory history
* Track stock inflow and outflow

### Stock Adjustment

* Manual inventory corrections
* Damaged stock adjustments
* Inventory reconciliation
* Adjustment history

### Procurement

* Supplier management
* Purchase order management
* Goods received tracking
* Procurement history

### Orders Management

* Sales order management
* Purchase order tracking
* Order status monitoring
* Customer and supplier information

### AI Assistant

Powered by Groq, the AI Assistant provides:

* Inventory insights
* Product recommendations
* Stock optimization suggestions
* Business-related queries
* Smart inventory assistance

### Audit Trail

* Complete activity logs
* User action tracking
* Inventory modification history
* System monitoring

